  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: Exhibit IX - The Countess Morvayne
  Body: 'Oil on canvas, 1760. The sitter was celebrated for her beauty and her appetite.


    The
    canvas is bare. Four long scratches run across the frame, from the inside out.'
