  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: Exhibit III - A Hunter's Reliquary
  Body: 'Walnut casket with silver fittings, containing eleven ash stakes, each snapped
    in two.


    Donated by the Morvayne family, who gave its provenance only as
    "the east lawn".


    The stakes'' previous owners have not been identified.'
  ReadClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d827ef23d1b788f4b92b1131a21aa803, type: 3}
  Verb: Read
